OL,3,GNEWSAJury in trial of man accused of
OL,4,AChloe Mitchell murder sworn in
OL,5,
OL,6,FA jury of seven women and five men in
OL,7,Fthe trial of man accused of the murder
OL,8,Fof Chloe Mitchell in Ballymena has been
OL,9,Fsworn in.
OL,11,FBrandon Rainey, formerly of James
OL,12,FStreet, Ballymena, denies murdering the
OL,13,F21-year-old on 3 June 2023 and
OL,14,Fpreventing the lawful burial of her
OL,15,Fremains.
OL,17,FThe 30-year-old defendant appeared in
OL,18,Fthe dock wearing a grey tracksuit and
OL,19,Fconfirmed his name and then replied
OL,20,F"yes" when asked if he was ready for
OL,21,Fhis trial.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
